OL,3,AHow AI visionary Jensen Huang was
OL,4,Aundone by his own bad decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt spawned a plethora of viral memes,
OL,7,Fseeing Huang as the man caught by the
OL,8,FColdplay kiss-cam with a married
OL,9,Fcolleague, or singing along to George
OL,10,FMichael's classic hit about betrayal,
OL,11,FCareless Whisper.
